Derivato da sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2 (Nils Reimers e UKP Lab,
https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2), licenza Apache 2.0
